  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "May has a bag. \"Sam, put your arm in.\" \"Is it a banana?\" asks Sam. \"No, it isn't.\" \"Is it a lemon?\" \"No, it isn't.\" \"Is it small?\" \"Yes, it is.\"",
      "\"Is it a kiwi?\" \"Yes, it is!\" Sam has a kiwi in his hand. It is brown. \"Wow!\" says Sam. \"Now you, May.\" May puts her arm in.",
      "\"Is it a lemon?\" asks May. \"Yes, it is.\" \"Fruit is good for the body.\" \"I have water and lemons.\" \"Let's make lemonade.\" Sam smiles. \"Good game!\""
    ],
    "summary": "May hides fruit in a bag. Sam puts his arm in the bag and asks yes or no questions. They find a kiwi and a lemon and make lemonade.",
